abstract: >-
  RT-Seg is a modular toolkit for segmenting and labeling LLM reasoning traces, enabling more systematic, reproducible, and fine-grained research on the structure of intermediate reasoning artifacts.

keywords:
  - "semantic text segmentation"
  - "reasoning traces"
  - "chain-of-thought"
  - "LLM interpretability"
  - "reasoning trace segmentation"
